       ]
      },
      "description": "Send (or, in demo mode when no SMS gateway is configured, generate and return as demo_code — always the fixed code 123456 in demo mode) an OTP to confirm a collection with the dealer. Required before Record Collection — a collection cannot be recorded without a verified OTP."
